<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Banco Frances plans $44.9 mln dividend.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Banco Frances plans $44.9 mln dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Banco Frances said Friday its board will propose to the next shareholders' meeting the payment of a 20 percent dividend in cash, representing $25.6 million, and another one of 15 percent in shares, or $19.2 million.</p>
<p>The dividends correspond to the period ended June 30.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
